Short:        vbcc C compiler for UP-Term
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     spotup@gmail.com (spotUP)
Type:         dev/c
Version:      @VERSION@
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0; m68k-020
Requires:     comm/term/up-term.lha >= @NEEDSBASE@ (it brings the patched ixemul.library)
Distribution: Aminet

vbcc 0.9h patch2 (vc, vbccm68k, vasm, vlink and the m68k-amigaos target, unmodified from the author)
with UP-Term's configuration, for an UP-Term window. The Amiga NDK headers are not included: point
NDKINC: at your Include_H drawer.

Needs the base archive up-term.lha (version @NEEDSBASE@ or newer) installed first.

Install: unpack, double-click Install. Uninstall removes what this archive installed.

Licence: vbcc, vasm, vlink: redistributable unmodified, non-commercial use.
